<div class="wrapper">
  <h1 data-i18n="relocate.heading">Relocating to Las Cruces</h1>
  <p class="why-las-cruces__intro" data-i18n="relocate.intro">Moving here for a new job, a military assignment, school, or a fresh start? Here's a practical starting point, and how I can help you find a home from wherever you are now.</p>
</div>

<section class="wrapper relocate__section">
  <h2 data-i18n="relocate.workHeading">Coming Here for Work or School</h2>
</section>
<section class="services-grid wrapper relocate__grid">
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.nmsuH">New Mexico State University</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.nmsuB">NMSU's main campus is on the south side of town. Neighborhoods near campus make for a very short commute, and most of the city is an easy drive away.</p>
    <p class="relocate__link"><a href="/neighborhoods/near-nmsu/" data-i18n="nbhd.readGuide">Read the guide →</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.wsmrH">White Sands Missile Range</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.wsmrB">The range's main post is on the far side of the Organ Mountains, roughly 25 miles east of town on US 70 over San Augustin Pass. The East Mesa and Talavera sit on the side of town closest to the pass.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.spaceportH">Spaceport America</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.spaceportB">Spaceport America is in the desert north of Las Cruces, roughly an hour's drive up I-25.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.militaryH">Fort Bliss and Holloman AFB</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.militaryB">Fort Bliss is in El Paso, about 45 minutes south on I-10. Holloman Air Force Base is near Alamogordo, about 70 miles east past White Sands.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrapper relocate__section">
  <h2 data-i18n="relocate.aroundHeading">Getting Around</h2>
</section>
<section class="services-grid wrapper relocate__grid">
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.highwaysH">Two Interstates</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.highwaysB">I-10 and I-25 meet in Las Cruces. El Paso is about 45 minutes south, and Albuquerque is roughly three and a half hours north.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.airportH">Flying In and Out</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.airportB">The nearest airport with regular commercial flights is El Paso International, about 45 minutes away.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrapper relocate__section">
  <h2 data-i18n="relocate.householdHeading">Setting Up Your Household</h2>
</section>
<section class="services-grid wrapper relocate__grid">
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.utilitiesH">Utilities</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.utilitiesB">Inside its service area, City of Las Cruces Utilities provides natural gas, water, wastewater, and trash service, and El Paso Electric provides electricity. Outside city limits, services can differ, so confirm them for each property.</p>
    <p class="relocate__link"><a href="https://lascruces.gov/property/utilities/utility-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="relocate.lcuLink">City of Las Cruces Utilities →</a></p>
    <p class="relocate__link"><a href="https://www.epelectric.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="relocate.epeLink">El Paso Electric →</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.mvdH">Driver's License and Vehicles</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.mvdB">New Mexico gives new residents a limited time to switch to a New Mexico driver's license and register their vehicles. Check the MVD's website for the current deadlines and the documents to bring.</p>
    <p class="relocate__link"><a href="https://www.mvd.newmexico.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="relocate.mvdLink">New Mexico MVD →</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.schoolsH">Schools</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.schoolsB">Most of the city is served by Las Cruces Public Schools, while communities in the southern part of the county fall under Gadsden Independent School District. Always confirm school assignment by address with the district before you buy.</p>
    <p class="relocate__link"><a href="https://www.lcps.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="relocate.lcpsLink">Las Cruces Public Schools →</a></p>
    <p class="relocate__link"><a href="https://www.gisd.k12.nm.us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="relocate.gisdLink">Gadsden ISD →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrapper relocate__section">
  <h2 data-i18n="relocate.remoteHeading">Buying From a Distance</h2>
</section>
<section class="services-grid wrapper relocate__grid">
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.virtualH">Virtual Tours</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.virtualB">Can't be here in person? Request a virtual tour from any listing page, and I'll walk you through the home live on video.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.matchH">Help Choosing an Area</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.matchB">Tell me about your commute, budget, and what you want nearby, and I'll suggest neighborhoods to start with.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="relocate.pointH">One Point of Contact</h3>
    <p data-i18n="relocate.pointB">I'll coordinate showings, inspections, and the steps to closing, so you can make fewer trips before moving day.</p>
  </div>
</section>

